Cyberpunk style: A neon-drenched nighttime cityscape split dramatically down the middle—on the left, a futuristic interpretation of colonial Southeast Asian architecture with glowing orchids and tropical foliage illuminated by holographic advertisements; on the right, gothic university spires reimagined with pulsing circuit patterns and cold blue lighting, bare winter trees with fiber optic branches. The two halves are connected by a glitching, fragmented digital bridge suspended over a void filled with streaming data particles. Silhouettes of running figures can be seen on both sides, their forms dissolving into pixels where the two worlds meet. Rain falls on the tropical side while snow drifts on the collegiate side, both precipitation rendered as luminous droplets. The color palette contrasts warm magenta and orange tones against cool cyan and purple, creating visual tension between the two distinct urban environments united by their shared energy and youthful chaos.
